755	// detachedRegistry tracks upgraded streams of handlers with stream_detached
756	// set. It is process-wide because those streams outlive the handler (and
757	// config) that started them; the only thing that ends them from the outside
758	// is the removal of their upstream.
759	type detachedRegistry struct {
